      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PIPELINES (LANDING & CORE)\n• Pipe 1: GMAIL EXTRACT — Scans Gmail inbox for attachments relevant to FY tax year. Lands raw metadata + file hash to landing.tax_documents.\n\n• Pipe 2: FOLDER EXTRACT — Scans X:\\data\\tax-collector\\staging for PDFs, invoices, and receipts dropped manually. SHA-256 deduplication against core. Classifies via local Ollama. Moves files to year folders.\n\n• Pipe 3: LOAD CORE — Merges landing.tax_documents into core.tax_documents via idempotent UPSERT. Runs few-shot Ollama re-classification on any unclassified records using confirmed examples as training context.\n\n• Pipe 4: NOTIFY REVIEW — Sends daily email digest of documents requiring human review (confidence < 0.6 or NEEDS_REVIEW status).",
